WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.044 --> 00:00:06.153
"Dad's missing!" Harry said.

2
00:00:06.154 --> 00:00:11.258
"Missing?" Oliver stopped petting Rover.

3
00:00:11.259 --> 00:00:15.791
"I haven't seen him since breakfast," Harry said.

4
00:00:15.792 --> 00:00:20.340
"He brought work home this weekend," Emmy said.

5
00:00:20.341 --> 00:00:23.968
"He's probably working at the kitchen table."

6
00:00:23.969 --> 00:00:28.812
Harry crossed his arms and shook his head. "Nope."

7
00:00:28.813 --> 00:00:32.722
"That's strange," Emmy said.

8
00:00:32.723 --> 00:00:36.152
The kids looked everywhere downstairs.

9
00:00:36.153 --> 00:00:41.439
They called loudly. "D-a-a-a-d!"

10
00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:45.727
But they couldn't find him.

11
00:00:45.728 --> 00:00:49.684
"Maybe he's outside," Harry said.

12
00:00:49.685 --> 00:00:56.020
The kids checked the yard and the garage.

13
00:00:56.021 --> 00:01:03.778
"Maybe he's playing hide-and-seek," Oliver said.

14
00:01:03.779 --> 00:01:12.466
But Dad wasn't hiding anywhere.

15
00:01:12.467 --> 00:01:16.132
"Let's look upstairs now," Harry said.

16
00:01:16.133 --> 00:01:19.543
The kids went back inside.

17
00:01:19.544 --> 00:01:26.172
Upstairs, Rover ran to a hall closet.

18
00:01:26.173 --> 00:01:29.791
He whined and pawed at the door.

19
00:01:29.792 --> 00:01:33.389
"Rover, there's nothing in this closet!"

20
00:01:33.390 --> 00:01:37.949
Emmy dragged the dog away.

21
00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:43.313
The kids searched all the rooms.

22
00:01:43.314 --> 00:01:47.624
Then Rover ran back to the closet door.

23
00:01:47.625 --> 00:01:52.766
"Rover, there's nothing in this closet!" Emmy said again.

24
00:01:52.767 --> 00:01:54.801
"Look!"

25
00:01:54.802 --> 00:01:59.519
She pulled open the door. "Eek!"

26
00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:02.571
Dad jumped up from a chair.

27
00:02:02.572 --> 00:02:06.666
He pulled off his headphones.

28
00:02:06.667 --> 00:02:13.611
"You're not missing!" Oliver hugged Dad.

29
00:02:13.612 --> 00:02:16.855
"We were calling for you."

30
00:02:16.856 --> 00:02:21.168
"I couldn't hear you with my headphones," Dad said.

31
00:02:21.169 --> 00:02:27.192
"Do you like my new office?"

32
00:02:27.193 --> 00:02:32.204
"You have everything you need," Emmy said.

33
00:02:32.205 --> 00:02:41.602
"Except a sign for the door!" Harry said.

